rver from Druzzil Ro to Brell. I'm still new to this server and was wondering was the requirements on joining the guild beside getting to know the guildmates, getting sponsors. Is there a lv restriction in joining? <br>
Here's a little background:<br>
I have been playing druid(lv52) and (lv54)monk in Druzzil Ro. I've been to plane raids mostly with my monk when I was in DR and here are other list of raids that I've attended: VOX, Naf, WW, Necro, KK, VS in KC, CoM, Queen in chardok, element in BW, and I've attended most of the eppic process on different classes. <br>
Well thats all i have to write for now. I'm looking forward on replies and meeting the memebers in the near future.<br>
<br>
Seiya<br>
