Well I'm still trying to level as fast as i can, and i know how boring sometimes at lower lv since not much excitement is going on. <br>
Anyways, thanks for your replies and input to my questions, and I'll be looking forward to get back to this board at later times to ask about joining you guys, thats when i get 50+. =)<br>
Cya all in the game and safe adventure. <br>
<br>
Seiya Lv 32 Monk. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#E6E8fA><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub24.ezboard.com/udezianthunderfoot.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Dezian Thunderfoot</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br>  Posts: 14<br> <font color=#1F2EA0>(5/5/01 9:32:07 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=158.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> <img src="http://www.ezboard.com/images/posticons/pi_cry.gif" align=absmiddle>  Re: Thanks for the replies</span><hr size=1> gah nother monkey ...<br>
